Package: github520-deploy
Version: 1.1~milestone.1-2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: WS-CatGirl <wscatgirl@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: 160
Depends: bash, curl, ca-certificates, iproute2, gawk, util-linux, systemd
Recommends: btrfs-progs, snapper, sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/WS-CatGirl/github520-deploy
Description: GitHub520 hosts manager with backups and a systemd timer
 GitHub520 Deploy updates the GitHub520 block in /etc/hosts, keeps
 timestamped backups, can restore the original hosts file, and installs
 an hourly systemd timer.
 .
 The package manages files under /usr and does not modify /etc/hosts
 automatically. Run "sudo github520-deploy install" after installation.
